<title>USA: BOXING-DE LA HOYA RETAINS WBC WELTERWEIGHT CROWN.</title>
<headline>BOXING-DE LA HOYA RETAINS WBC WELTERWEIGHT CROWN.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oscar de la Hoya retained his World Boxing Council welterweight title on Saturday when he knocked out David Kamau of Kenya at 2:54 of the second round of their scheduled 12-round bout.</p>
</text>
